      "content": "i did the right thing. i stood up and told the truth about what was happening at the firm. and now i have nothing. no job, no friends, everyone just looks at me like i'm some kind of pariah. i sacrificed my whole life for what? to be sitting here in a dark apartment with absolutely nothing left. it feels like i'm just taking up space at this point.",
