      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the profound grief and betrayal you have felt; calling yourself a fool when you merely showed integrity makes the argument even heavier. There is no version of the future where you stop being judged, which is why the constant weight feels so unbearable right now, but your current pain separates the \"right choice\" from the \"outcome of failure.\" Please remember that this lonely place does not mean your moral courage was wrong, even though it feels like that when you cannot find anyone else in this silence.",
